    "answered": "Traced proposal admission through replication, queued support, storage release, quorum/current-term commit, propagation and application. Traced elections, term filtering, role reset, configuration activation and recovery, including the different lifetimes of entry completions, snapshots, committed application and read queues. Observations are source-based; no property execution or violation is claimed.",
